    "text": "C2 holds on this fixed panel only if rootfind-m3 work.complete is true and bitop total is strictly below each of the four Groebner arms on every one of eight matched targets and every measured repeat; otherwise report each ratio and failed/censored pair. C3 uses the same completeness rule and reports m2 versus m3 separately. Wall time is secondary and requires L2, a paired 95% interval below one and a difference outside A/A spread; familywise alpha 0.0125 for any inferential language.",
